{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3b3b9d28-1959-8300-b360-fa36bdbb7bc0",
  "created_at": "2026-02-06T14:19:34-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sheila Gallagher",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:17:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:17:38-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Good afternoon. So, I'm standing in a fabric store right now with a cart full of ribbon, I'm doing a bunch of work for a church sale, and I was driving over here and it reminded me that I keep meaning to call you. I've been meaning to for about two weeks, honestly. I walk that block every morning and I drive it too, so I hear it from both sides."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:18:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, what's going on on the block?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so there's a manhole cover in the street that has sunk down. It's lower than the pavement around it, and every time a car goes over it, it rings. Like a clank, a loud metal clank, bang, every single time. It's not a pothole exactly, it's the cover itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:18:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. About how big is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:18:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, about two feet across. Round, the usual size, I think. And the pavement right around the edge looks a little broken up, but mostly it's the sinking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:18:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And where is this? What's the address or closest house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of my house, 5 Ayrault Street. On the Hill, yes. So what I'd like is for the street to be added to the repair list, whatever list you keep for that. I don't know if there is one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:19:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is, we log these and the crew goes through them. I'll put in a work request for the sunken manhole cover at 5 Ayrault. Do you want a callback number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:19:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It's 401-555-0160."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-oh. Got it. I can't give you a date for it, but it's in the system as of today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:19:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I just wanted it on the list. Thank you very much, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:19:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Enjoy the ribbon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T14:19:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye now."
    }
  ],
